id: pm-review-targeted-evidence-requests
title: Request the smallest missing review evidence for each obligation
description: "Compile bounded acquisition queues for selected unresolved findings and criterion gaps, retaining requests until revision-bound native source or test evidence arrives."
type: Feature
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-26T00:38:35.933Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-26T01:03:04.807Z"
assignee: codex-agent
claim_principal: codex-agent
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: Every request names one current obligation and missing evidence type; Satisfied requests disappear only after bound evidence arrives; A 30-finding fixture emits a budgeted queue with exact omissions
parent: pm-review-epic
comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-26T00:39:02.666Z",codex-agent,"Overlap check: host CLI 2026.10.25 has no review-specific acquisition queue. Existing reviewCoverage supplies current criterion gaps, reviewCloseout verifies independent completion evidence, and pm-context context-next-evidence handles general minimum-cost acquisition planning. This feature compiles selected review obligations into one-artifact source/test requests with explicit revision-bound arrivals, using native SDK item reads and status roles. No provider transcript fetching or new import/sync mutation path is needed."
  "2026-10-26T00:46:43.486Z",codex-agent,"Implemented a read-only review requests SDK/CLI boundary with one strict bounded packet schema, durable target-version keys, explicit one-native-link arrivals, current SDK evidence revalidation, registry-role lifecycle decisions, exact budget omissions and typed remedies. Targeted fixture measured 30 findings: 7 requests plus 23 exact omission keys in 6378 JSON characters; character cap emits 6 plus 24 omissions in 5974 characters. Seeded replay and every-step peer interleaving checks are in progress. No shared mutable request journal, leases or persisted budgets were introduced."
  "2026-10-26T01:00:42.509Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proof: restored only registerReviewCommands from main while retaining the implementation and SDK exports. node --test --test-name-pattern=\"registered CLI\" test/requests.test.ts failed exit 1 because review requests was not registered; restored the function afterward. Public tracker validation: 57 items, 48 selected obligations, 5 pending, 3 emitted, 2 exact omissions, 43 terminal-role skips, 3606 JSON characters/bytes, CRLF file parity, 120 durable inputs unchanged. Linked pm test run passed its 2 boundary assertions; tracker test-result recording is disabled, so this comment records the result without changing policy."
  "2026-10-26T01:03:04.806Z",codex-agent,"Additional boundary verification: corrupt foreign tracker documents now skip unavailable items or report coverage_unavailable rather than allowing a corpus-read exception to escape. Compact history retains original durable version addressing. Peer coverage-source drift and post-validation caller mutation each pass their dedicated regressions. Typecheck, test typecheck, lint, zero-duplication, build and docstring checks passed locally; full release gates are reserved for CI as requested."
